`design_nodes_omitted`, `design_nodes_absent` and `design_nodes_unreachable` name frames the resolution could not show. A frame in `design_nodes_omitted` still exists and may be assigned -- the engineer is told it was not shown -- but write no acceptance criterion whose subject is a frame nobody has read.
{%- endif %}

